  <AltText>
    Sprite of quinbe's OC, Vara. She has dark skin, lavender eyes, and golden blonde-ish hair. She's wearing a purple and lavender undershirt that shows some cleavage. She has a light purple coat that is worn over the undershirt. She's also wearing purple pants, grey boots, and lavender goggles with green lenses. Quite fitting for a pirate.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    A sprite of Vara.
    Defintiely someone who I wouldn't want to make mad.
    That aside, was quite fun :3
